Its public scratch latches 4–6 may have new
values. The source reader overwrites its incoming frame and length-test
latches before use, and the original gate fetch overwrites operand latches
before BF. No prior scratch-latch value is a parameter of a source request.
These are the PR57.D4 and AIF reader entry contracts. Finite dispatcher
phase and port tokens are set to that canonical source-ready entry by
